speechtext:
It is not an important matter, but one of ways and means of doing a thing and the established
44561-83}
practice. I am not questioning how it is being done, but I think we should stick to one rule.

On this matter of partisanship, I am reminded of the old saying that:
The devil was sick, the devil a monk would be;
The devil was well, the devil a monk was he.
